{"id":"sikafloor-264","rules":[{"id":"sikafloor-264:primer:3c2cf49d","type":"primer","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":["sikafloor-161"],"text":"As a clear primer without the addition of Pigment (Sikafloor 161) Please refer to Sikafloor 161 PDS","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikafloor_-264.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 08.05","section":"USES","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-264.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-264:restriction:d3fe08df","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not apply Sikafloor®-264 on substrates with rising moisture.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikafloor_-264.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 08.05","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-264.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-264:restriction:b0309ce9","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"For roller / textured coatings: Uneven substrates as well as inclusions of dirt cannot and should not be covered by thin sealer coats","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikafloor_-264.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 08.05","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-264.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-264:restriction:2c4178d0","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":true,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"If heating is required do not use gas, oil, paraffin or other fossil fuel heaters, these produce large quantities of both CO2 and H2O water vapour, which may adversely affect the finish","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikafloor_-264.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 08.05","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-264.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-264:primer:626751cd","type":"primer","polarity":"yes","conditional":true,"tags":{},"mentions":["sikafloor-161"],"text":"For up to 6% pbw, prime with sikafloor 161 Primer: Make sure that a continuous, pore free coat covers the substrate","heading":"APPLICATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikafloor_-264.pdf","page":5,"page_end":5,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 08.05","section":"APPLICATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-264.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-264:product_relation:d4054a31","type":"product_relation","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":["sikafloor-161"],"text":"Apply Sikafloor®- 161 /-160 by roller or squeegee","heading":"APPLICATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikafloor_-264.pdf","page":5,"page_end":5,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 08.05","section":"APPLICATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-264.html"}}]}